cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "NarraCare: A Safety-Aware Narrative Recommender for 60-Day Rehabilitation"
abstract: >
  NarraCare is a simulated rehabilitation recommender combining a user simulator,
  contextual recommendation, five runtime safety pre-filters, a template-based
  narrator and reward composition. SAPS combines LinUCB reward UCB with a Beta
  safety bonus and an internal safe-arm gate. Evaluation uses 20 synthetic
  personas over 60 days; final top-1 evaluation reports ungated proposal IER and executed-rule SVR
  across ten seeds. A separate LLM tool-calling agent provides live dialogue.
authors:
  - family-names: "NarraCare Group"
    given-names: "CA6124 2026S1"
date-released: 2026-10-17
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
keywords:
